Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:50:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] media: gc550: add driver skeleton, lifecycle and
 registration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add core USB driver skeleton, module device table, and reference-
counted device lifecycle for the AVerMedia Live Gamer Extreme (GC550)
capture card (USB ID 07ca:4710 / 07ca:0550).

The GC550 combines an Analog Devices ADV7604 HDMI receiver, Lattice
ECP3 FPGA packetizer, and Cypress FX3 USB 3.0 controller delivering
uncompressed 1080p60 video and stereo audio.

This patch establishes:
- USB probe and disconnect lifecycle tied to a unified kref.
- Mutexes and IRQ-safe spinlocks for V4L2, command, and stream gating.
- Module metadata and device ID registration.
- Kconfig, Makefile, and MAINTAINERS entries.

Signed-off-by: Øystein Lie <oeystein@gengartv.com>
